'''Frostfire Greataxe''' is a version of [[Nord Greataxe]] upgraded with a [[Frostfire Essence]]. It loses a small amount of [[Slash|slash damage]] in exchange for a larger amount of [[fire]] and [[Frost|frost damage]].

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit combo (wide swing, wide swing, vertical overhead) with double damage on the last hit, 1.5x [[staggering]] and no multitarget penalty.
* The faster secondary attack deals 0.5x damage and 4x staggering.

An upgraded Nord Greataxe will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Frostfire Greataxe.

